WEBVTT

00:05:29.039 --> 00:05:31.436
Oh, no way, that was a bridge too far.

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:32.855
Local electeds?

00:05:33.312 --> 00:05:35.158
That was a bridge too far.

00:05:35.616 --> 00:05:37.405
And that was in 2001.

00:05:38.214 --> 00:05:39.991
And I think you'll agree with me now.

00:05:40.015 --> 00:05:41.620
In 2020 it's gotten even worse --

00:05:41.644 --> 00:05:43.360
that division, that tribalism.

00:05:43.384 --> 00:05:44.824
We won't sit down at dinner

00:05:44.848 --> 00:05:46.966
with people who voted differently than us.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:49.738
We, like, see a mean tweet
from our best friend --

00:05:49.762 --> 00:05:52.165
a tweet that, like,
doesn't fit with our worldview,

00:05:52.189 --> 00:05:54.007
and all of a sudden they're canceled.

00:05:54.031 --> 00:05:56.677
The purity politics of the moment gone.

00:05:56.701 --> 00:05:57.873
I sometimes wake up --

00:05:57.897 --> 00:05:59.680
I don't know what we're going to do.